{"year":"2022","content":[{"type":"text","content_text":"The 75th Cannes Film Festival took place from May 17 to 28, 2022, with French actor <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 5443, 'screen_type': person}\">Vincent Lindon</a> as jury president and actress Virginie Efira as master of ceremonies. Sweden's <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 56370, 'screen_type': person}\">Ruben Östlund</a> won his second Palme d'Or with the satire <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 497828, 'screen_type': movie}\">Triangle of Sadness</a> (2022), five years after <i>The Square</i>. To celebrate the festival's anniversary, the jury gave a 75th Anniversary Prize to <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 914203, 'screen_type': movie}\">Tori et Lokita</a> (Tori and Lokita, 2022), by the Dardenne brothers, and honorary Palmes d'Or went to Forest Whitaker and Tom Cruise."},{"type":"person_list","title":"The Jury","persons":[{"id":5443,"name":"Vincent Lindon","profile_path":"/tjRKMKfsIH7MrqtN7cMPIZubSXa.jpg"},{"id":229931,"name":"Asghar Farhadi","profile_path":"/mCEpFbimAvhiR3P91h5b8UEUhY.jpg"},{"id":15556,"name":"Rebecca Hall","profile_path":"/coC58ANiDbqRIyle5zEl9QDektf.jpg"},{"id":144817,"name":"Ladj Ly","profile_path":"/tgnOzjBHSGwIXAcG3tHvzggNCGJ.jpg"},{"id":71872,"name":"Jeff Nichols","profile_path":"/qUZSdnZdYbF2JJe4LOxQiMl4x3J.jpg"},{"id":53975,"name":"Deepika Padukone","profile_path":"/rzvvBQ0r6oiqDdzcsdTRB7jN4Rx.jpg"},{"id":87722,"name":"Noomi Rapace","profile_path":"/m0J6ZqEyNljqF1DXBoC9DcMStHP.jpg"},{"id":71609,"name":"Joachim Trier","profile_path":"/o5KXJRWbzyGYSxDhXsBqbCiZnqU.jpg"},{"id":69489,"name":"Jasmine Trinca","profile_path":"/idxRGFkuTwxKZZNtDBTY84UzAPd.jpg"}]},{"type":"awards_nominees","name":"Palme d'Or","nominee_list":[{"type":"movie","id":497828,"name":"Triângulo da Tristeza","image_path":"/scfQwUUe0MQb0T5khF1x5e4HSoR.jpg","director":"Ruben Östlund","winner":true,"backdrop_path":"/vNPY4oCSUp7CxbHkKJNRx1fmCl0.jpg"},{"type":"movie","id":615952,"na